:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=CFGTCPTELN.Configure TCP/IP TELNET (CFGTCPTELN)
:P.The Configure TCP/IP TELNET (CFGTCPTELN) command works with the
TELNET server menu.
:P.The command has no parameters.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGTELNA.Change TELNET Attributes (CHGTELNA)
:P.The Change TELNET Attributes (CHGTELNA) command works with the telnet
server's attributes, kept in the TCP/IP server table in QUSRSYS and read
when the server starts.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/AUTOSTART'.Autostart server (AUTOSTART)
:P.The autostart server for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/NBRSVR'.Number servers (NBRSVR)
:P.The number servers for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 200.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/NBRTASK'.Number of tasks (NBRTASK)
:P.The number of tasks for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 200.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/TIMMRKTIMO'.Session keep alive timeout (TIMMRKTIMO)
:P.The session keep alive timeout for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 2419200.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/ENBWIDE'.Enable 3270 wide-screen (ENBWIDE)
:P.The enable 3270 wide-screen for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/NBRFLDS'.Number of 3270 input fields (NBRFLDS)
:P.The number of 3270 input fields for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 126 to 9999.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *RPY.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/DFTNVTTYPE'.Default NVT type (DFTNVTTYPE)
:P.The default NVT type for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *VT100, *NVT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/CCSID'.Coded character set identifier (CCSID)
:P.The coded character set identifier&colon. the code page and character
set the data is in, or is to be converted to.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 65533.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MULTINAT, *BRITISH, *DUTCH, *FINNISH, *FRENCH,
*FRENCHCAN, *GERMAN, *ITALIAN, *NORDAN, *SPANISH, *SWEDISH, *SWISS.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/TBLVTOUT'.Outgoing EBCDIC/ASCII table (TBLVTOUT)
:P.The outgoing EBCDIC/ASCII table for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CCSID:EPK.
:PD.The CCSID determines the conversion.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/TBLVTIN'.Incoming ASCII/EBCDIC table (TBLVTIN)
:P.The incoming ASCII/EBCDIC table for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CCSID:EPK.
:PD.The CCSID determines the conversion.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/ALWSSL'.Allow Transport Layer Security (ALWSSL)
:P.The allow Transport Layer Security for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*ONLY:EPK.
:PD.The only one&colon. an error is sent when more than one matches.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
